---
source: tests/surface_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
The one command a session runs at start

Usage: mnemex brief [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --for <DIR>       The directory to ask about. Defaults to the working directory
      --budget <BYTES>  The output budget, in bytes. Defaults to 16384
      --json            Emit the versioned envelope
  -h, --help            Print help
